		<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="gd">Togalach far an cumar carbadan-eiridinn fhad 's a bhios iad a' feitheamh ri gairm èiginn.</skos:scopeNote>
		<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">AMBULANCE STATION</skos:prefLabel>
