		<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="gd">TAIGH-CUSBAINN</skos:prefLabel>
		<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="gd">Taigh no togalach an riaghaltais, mar is trice ann am port-mara, far a bheilear a' togail na cusbainn 's a' toirt cead do longan a thighinn a-steach dhan dùthaich.</skos:scopeNote>
