		<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="gd">Clach anns an deach na ciad litrichean nan ainmean aig bean is fear bainnse a sgrìobadh, mar is trice le ceann-là. Bhiodh a' chlach fhèin na h-àrd-doras mar is trice no am broinn balla.</skos:scopeNote>
		<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">MARRIAGE STONE</skos:prefLabel>
