		<skos:related rdf:resource="http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/1/concepts/664" />
		<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">A building or site where the carcasses of whales were butchered and rendered into by-products, such as oil, fenk and whalebone.</skos:scopeNote>
