		<skos:related rdf:resource="http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/1/concepts/1480" />
		<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">A tower in which shot is made from molten lead poured through sieves at top and falling into water at bottom.</skos:scopeNote>
