				<skos:broader rdf:resource="http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/1/concepts/683" />
				<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">A site where pyroligneous acid is produced. Pyroligneous acid is a product of the destructive distillation of wood, and was a commercial source of acetic acid.</skos:scopeNote>
