		<skos:related rdf:resource="http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/1/concepts/1075" />
		<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">A simple iron-smelting furnace used to produce blooms of iron from bog iron ore.</skos:scopeNote>
