		<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="gd">MÈINN ANTAMOIN</skos:prefLabel>
		<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="gd">Làrach far a bheil acainnean is structaran airson dùsgadh antamon, eileamaid mheatailteach a chuirear co-mheatailtean airson 's gum bi iad nas treasa agus nas cruaidhe. Bhathar a' creidsinn roimhe gun robh buadhan slànachaidh aig antamon.</skos:scopeNote>
		<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">ANTIMONY MINE</skos:prefLabel>
		<dcterms:created rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2006-07-03T14:26:54</dcterms:created>
		<dcterms:issued rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2018-03-28T11:55:34</dcterms:issued>
