		<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="gd">TAIGH ACAINN-TOGAIL</skos:prefLabel>
		<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="gd">Togalach sa bheil einnsean, mar is trice le taigh-goileadair is similear co-cheangailte ris. Thathar ga chleachdadh gus daoine, stuthan is clachan-mèinneir a ghluasad suas is sìos sloc mèinne.</skos:scopeNote>
		<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">WINDER HOUSE</skos:prefLabel>
