		<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="gd">IONAD GAS-GUAIL</skos:prefLabel>
		<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="gd">Togalaichean is structaran a tha co-cheangailte ri saothrachadh, giullachd is stòradh ceò-guail.</skos:scopeNote>
		<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">COAL GAS STRUCTURE</skos:prefLabel>
