		<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="gd">TAIGH-GAS</skos:prefLabel>
		<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="gd">Fo-thogalach, mar is trice fear a sholaireas gas airson solasan togalaich àraidh (m.e. stèiseanan-rèile, factaraidhean, is msaa), seach FACTARAIDH GAS poblach.</skos:scopeNote>
		<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">GAS HOUSE</skos:prefLabel>
