		<skos:related rdf:resource="http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/1/concepts/502994" />
		<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">An office used by a qualified pilot, expert in ship-handling and with local knowledge, who assists the captain or master to take a vessel in or out of a harbour or through narrow waters.</skos:scopeNote>
