		<skos:related rdf:resource="http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/1/concepts/1784" />
		<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">An area used for the taking off and landing of aircraft. The site will often include associated buildings, equipment and other installations.</skos:scopeNote>
