		<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="gd">CARBAD-ADHAIR</skos:prefLabel>
		<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="gd">Carbad-adhair, an rud slàn no pàirt dheth. Mairidh carbadan-adhair beò gu tric mar chuimhneachain, freiceadan geata no air làrach far an do bhuail e ris an talamh.</skos:scopeNote>
		<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">AIRCRAFT</skos:prefLabel>
