		<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="gd">DROCHAID</skos:prefLabel>
		<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="gd">Structar a tha a' dol thairis cnap-starra 's a bheir cothrom siubhail thairis air, can abhainn, rathad, mòr-ghil no rathad-iarainn. Cleachd briathar nas mionaidiche ma tha fios air.</skos:scopeNote>
