				<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="gd">CRUINN-CUMHACHD THRAMAICHEAN</skos:prefLabel>
				<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="gd">Puist meatailt a chaidh a thogail gus càballan dealain aig trama a chumail an àirde, mar is trice ann am paidhrichean thairis air an rathad no tèarmann-meadhain an trama.</skos:scopeNote>
				<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">TRAMWAY POWER STANDARDS</skos:prefLabel>
