		<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="gd">DOCAICHEAN  CANÀIL</skos:prefLabel>
		<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="gd">Uisgeadan fosgailte, mar is trice fear fuadain, mun a bheil docannan-tioram no locan, cidheachan-tìreachaidh is taighean-bathair far an urrainn bathar is goireasan a thoirt far bhàrcannan, bhàtaichean caola 's shoithichean canail eile no an gluasad orra.</skos:scopeNote>
