		<skos:related rdf:resource="http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/1/concepts/1930" />
		<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">An upright wooden post from which a gate is suspended by its hinges. For brick or masonry structures use GATE PIER.</skos:scopeNote>
