		<skos:related rdf:resource="http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/1/concepts/398" />
		<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">A fortified permanent military base defended by at least one rampart and ditch, generally built for a single regiment of 500 or 1000 men, and containing accommodation for troops and officers, together with stores and ancillary buildings.</skos:scopeNote>
