		<skos:related rdf:resource="http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/1/concepts/502640" />
		<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Visible differences in growth of vegetation (cereal or grass and more rarely, root crops) caused by agricultural practices such as ploughing, spraying and manuring.</skos:scopeNote>
