		<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="gd">Togalach seirbheise aig taigh-dùthcha, tuathanas is msaa a chleachdar airson fuineadh. Mas e ionad coimeirsealta a tha ann, cleachd TAIGH-FUINE.</skos:scopeNote>
