		<skos:related rdf:resource="http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/1/concepts/503681" />
		<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">A platform which moves laterally on wheels, by which boats, railway carriages and engines may be moved from one place to another, eg. from one slipway to another parallel to it.</skos:scopeNote>
