		<skos:related rdf:resource="http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/1/concepts/1923" />
		<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">A stone erected to mark a site associated with Covenanters. For sites of coventicles use COVENANTERS MEETING PLACE.</skos:scopeNote>
