		<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="gd">Slighe le mullach os a cionn tro thogalach no tro thogalaichean air an ruigear raon fosgailte no clobhsa.</skos:scopeNote>
		<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">PEND</skos:prefLabel>
