		<skos:related rdf:resource="http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/1/concepts/500657" />
		<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">A building used to twin orphaned lambs with kebs (ewes that have lost their lambs).</skos:scopeNote>
