		<skos:related rdf:resource="http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/1/concepts/1655" />
		<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">A place, where a corpse could be laid whilst being carried on its way to burial, to allow the bearers to rest.</skos:scopeNote>
