		<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="gd">DROCHAID SGEADACHAIL</skos:prefLabel>
		<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="gd">Drochaid a chaidh a thogail gus dreach na tìre mun cuairt oirre a leasachadh. Gheibhear seo mar is trice air oighreachdan no ann am pàircichean às an 18mh is an 19mh linn.</skos:scopeNote>
		<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">ORNAMENTAL BRIDGE</skos:prefLabel>
